    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Applicant is in detention since 02.02.2022.\n2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 962,
      "end": 1009,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "02.02.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 995,
          "end": 1005
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33900460600852966
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Applicant's earlier bail applications were dismissed as withdrawn.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 1010,
      "end": 1076,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.273237407207489
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "However, in second, third and fourth bail application, trial Court was directed to expedite the trial within a period of six months from the date of the order.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 1077,
      "end": 1237,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28205379843711853
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "3 . As per the prosecution story, on 16.01.2024 prosecutrix along with her minor sister had gone to distribute laddus to his middle father.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1239,
      "end": 1378,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "16.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1276,
          "end": 1286
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14726386964321136
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "When she was returning along with her younger sister and cousin to home on the way NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-JBP:17035 2 MCRC-10503-2025 Neeraj Mehra meet and took her at the pretext of purchasing new plastic tiffins.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1379,
      "end": 1601,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1462,
          "end": 1487
        },
        {
          "text": "Neeraj Mehra",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1521,
          "end": 1533
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20825128257274628
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "When minor went along with him he told that he loves her and forcibly committed rape/aggravated penetrative sexual assault upon her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1602,
      "end": 1735,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3308071196079254
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Next day FIR was lodged.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1736,
      "end": 1760,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3066278100013733
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Neeraj Mehra vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 8 April, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/69389461/\n1 4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1761,
      "end": 1881,
      "entities": [
